      "date": "2026-05-06T11:30:58.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹29.12 (down from ₹47.78 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹37.1b (flat on FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.37b (down 39% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.4% (down from 10% in FY 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 2.8%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 2.0%. Revenue is forecast to grow 3.7% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Food industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
