      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.59 (up from ₹7.35 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹7.26b (down 14% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹696.6m (up 17% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.6% (up from 7.1% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 3.6% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 9.9% growth forecast for the Food industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 16% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 6% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
